  "|Based on the prescribed poems: \n'Woman cannot exist except by man, what is there in that to vex some of them so?' The statement above from the poem Give Me the Minstrel's Seat exemplifies|litotes|rhetorical question|transferred epithet|synecdoche": "set-african-poetry",
