  "|'Good warriors make others come to them and not go to others... When you induce opponents to come to you, then their force is always empty, like attacking emptiness with fullness, like throwing stones on eggs.'\nZhang Yu: The Art of War\n\nThe theme of the passage above is|folly of soldiers|inspiration|spurring people to action|war": "appreciation-prose",
