  "|'...How can I look at Oyo and say I hate long shiny cars? How can I come to the children and despise international schools? And Koomson comes, and the family sees Jesus Christ in him....'\n\nThe feeling conveyed by the speaker above is one of|anger|alienation|hope|despair": "appreciation-prose",
